# Payments & Settlement (MVP)

## Weekend rollup

On **Sunday 7:00 PM IST**, system generates fees for **completed** weekend
matches that have a **finalized playing squad** and a **saved carpool
assignment**, then sends exactly **one** weekend payment notification to the
charged players (in-app + individual WhatsApp). The eligible set may contain
Saturday only, Sunday only, or both. **Cancelled** matches attract no fees.

1. Pay via UPI deeplink (`upi://pay` from team VPA + amount) or any UPI app
2. Copy UTR
3. Upload payment screenshot (compress aggressively; keep legible)
4. Mark payment done in-app

Sunday 19:00 may bill Saturday only if Sunday is not yet completed. Admin may
regenerate charges after Sunday completes, but manual generation is silent and
must not send another payment notification.

## Amount

Per **squad member** per match:

- **Warmup:** match fee share (`matchFees ÷ squad size`)
- **Tournament:** prepaid entry pool
  (`tournament.totalFees ÷ plannedMatchCount`) ÷ squad size **plus** separate
  match/ground fees (`matchFees ÷ squad size`). Tournament create/edit records
  which **Admin prepaid** entry (`fees_paid_by_user_id`). That Admin is credited
  the full per-match pool on settlement (offsets their share and other dues);
  leftover credit becomes a reimbursement settled with UTR + screenshot. Ground
  fees still need organizer payout proof.

Plus from post-match carpool assignment (**any active player** may drive or ride):

- \+ ₹100 if passenger on a ride
- Driver credit ₹100 × passenger count

Non-squad riders/drivers still get a charge line for carpool fee/credit only
(match fee share stays ₹0). The tournament prepaid Admin always gets a charge
line when the pool is &gt; 0 so credits can reimburse even if they did not play.
Weekend netting: carpool + tournament credits offset that user’s other dues the
same weekend; leftover credit becomes a `settlement_reimbursements` row.

## Notification idempotency

- `weekend_settlements.notified_at` is claimed by the Sunday Cron
- Cron retries and concurrent invocations must not duplicate the notification
- There are no recurring unpaid payment reminders in MVP

## Admin

- After kickoff: assign drivers/passengers (or save nobody carpooled), then
  **complete** or **cancel** the match (no Cron auto-complete)
- Generate settlement manually from `/payments` (same completed + assigned rules)
- May mark player payment(s) as paid **offline**
- Settles driver reimbursements offline with UTR + screenshot
- Uploads organizer payout proof for **match / ground fees**. When the weekend
  has two matches, Admin confirms **same organizer** (one payment) or
  **different organizers** (one proof per match). Prepaid tournament entry
  stays with the collector. Settlement stays **collecting** until proofs are
  done.
- Confirms settlement complete when charges, reimbursements, and organizer
  payouts are cleared
- When player fees are collected but organizer proof is missing, Admin is
  reminded once (in-app + WhatsApp group)
- Re-generate must not reset paid / offline_paid / waived charges

## Storage

- Screenshots in Supabase Storage with size limits + server/client compression before upload
